    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/a89caafba231b07bebbbe540cfc38fb7.avif?t=1755023545\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><i></i><br><i></i><br><i>While on your way to meet with a friend, it appears you've been dragged to an unknown area. This area is known as the Little Big Backrooms. In hopes to find your friend, you'll have to make it to the very end. However this wont be a simple walk in the park as something lurks nearby.\u00a0</i><br><i>During this suspenseful journey, you'll travel across 7 main eerie spaces that tells one story that happens to be hidden away within them. Can you figure out what happened and make it out? Goodluck.</i>\u00a0<br><br><br> <i>Explore\u00a0unique areas.</i>\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/202b62fd7a83afad40d005e4e6c2092a.poster.avif?t=1755023545\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/202b62fd7a83afad40d005e4e6c2092a.webm?t=1755023545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/202b62fd7a83afad40d005e4e6c2092a.mp4?t=1755023545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<i>Experience odd sightings.\u00a0</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/c318e74d766487f7f61a111f56331d65.poster.avif?t=1755023545\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/c318e74d766487f7f61a111f56331d65.webm?t=1755023545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/c318e74d766487f7f61a111f56331d65.mp4?t=1755023545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u></u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay Features<br><br>- Exploration Based Gameplay</u></strong>Player will travel through several kinds of of areas featuring Pool Rooms, Storage Rooms, Illusion rooms, and much more you'll just have to see.\u00a0<br><br><strong><i><u>- Secrets Areas</u></i></strong>Player may encounter secret areas if they have a sharp eye.\u00a0<br><br><strong><i><u>- Zoom In Function</u><br><br><u>- Jumping</u></i><br>Very light platforming.\u00a0</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/a89caafba231b07bebbbe540cfc38fb7.avif?t=1755023545\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><i></i><br><i></i><br><i>While on your way to meet with a friend, it appears you've been dragged to an unknown area. This area is known as the Little Big Backrooms. In hopes to find your friend, you'll have to make it to the very end. However this wont be a simple walk in the park as something lurks nearby.\u00a0</i><br><i>During this suspenseful journey, you'll travel across 7 main eerie spaces that tells one story that happens to be hidden away within them. Can you figure out what happened and make it out? Goodluck.</i>\u00a0<br><br><br> <i>Explore\u00a0unique areas.</i>\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/202b62fd7a83afad40d005e4e6c2092a.poster.avif?t=1755023545\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/202b62fd7a83afad40d005e4e6c2092a.webm?t=1755023545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/202b62fd7a83afad40d005e4e6c2092a.mp4?t=1755023545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<i>Experience odd sightings.\u00a0</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/c318e74d766487f7f61a111f56331d65.poster.avif?t=1755023545\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/c318e74d766487f7f61a111f56331d65.webm?t=1755023545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583380/extras/c318e74d766487f7f61a111f56331d65.mp4?t=1755023545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u></u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay Features<br><br>- Exploration Based Gameplay</u></strong>Player will travel through several kinds of of areas featuring Pool Rooms, Storage Rooms, Illusion rooms, and much more you'll just have to see.\u00a0<br><br><strong><i><u>- Secrets Areas</u></i></strong>Player may encounter secret areas if they have a sharp eye.\u00a0<br><br><strong><i><u>- Zoom In Function</u><br><br><u>- Jumping</u></i><br>Very light platforming.\u00a0</strong></p>",
